Package: libastal-idle-notify0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: idle notification library for Astal shells
 Astal is a library collection for building desktop shells. This package
 contains the shared library, which reports user idle and resume through the
 ext-idle-notify Wayland protocol.

